> in calling scope.
> 
> Or another way in one step is :
> 
>   DT[,c3:=sum(DT[eval(.(grp)),p]<=p),by=id]
> 
> which uses the feature that eval() is already like what ..() will do in future.
> 
> But grouping by grp should be much faster and cleaner, if possible.
> 
> Matthew
